		(property "Description" "Synchronous boost with true output disconnect, 1.8-5.5 V in, up to 15 V out, 3.5 A switch, Burst Mode 25 uA from VIN plus 10-20 uA from VOUT, <1 uA shut down. MSOP-12 with exposed pad (solder it: it is PGND). Burst Mode limits the output to ~190 mA at 2.5 V in and ~300 mA at 3 V in for 9.6 V out; the tracker draws 15-50 mA, 250 mA on an LTE burst"
